====== TP-Link TL-WR940N ======

{{section>meta:infobox:432_warning#infobox_for_dataentries&noheader&nofooter&noeditbutton}}

The TP-Link WR940N is identical to the [[TL-WR941ND]] except that the antennas are not detachable and the **hardware version is different**. Only for WR940N v4 there seems to be no WR941ND-equivalent, yet.

  * WR940N **v1** is a WR941ND **v4**
  * WR940N **v2** is a WR941ND **v5**
  * WR940N **v3** is a WR941ND **v6**

A TP-Link WR940N v6.6 (as read from the label on the ethernet jacks, under the cover) uses the same OEM firmware as the v6. So it looks like all v6.x are the same as v6 as far as firmware goes.

